{
  "high_level_description": "A casual iPhone snapshot of an empty neighborhood clinic waiting area on a slow afternoon, with sage-green armchairs along the left wall, a low oak coffee table, and a tall window pouring daylight across the right side of the room.",
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "A small, quiet clinic waiting room photographed at eye level from across the room. Pale cream painted walls meet a light oak laminate floor. A large window spans most of the right wall, its thin white roller blinds pulled halfway up, letting sheer cool daylight pour diagonally across the floor in a soft directional shaft. Dust motes hang suspended in the light. A soft woven jute rug sits under the table area. The room reads as recently used but currently empty, with neutral cool-to-neutral white balance and accurate true colors throughout.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Three upholstered armchairs in muted sage-green fabric arranged loosely along the left wall in the midground, slightly worn seat cushions. Two chairs face forward; the third is angled a few degrees off the others toward the center of the room."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Single framed botanical print hung above the chairs at eye level on the cream wall, thin dark wooden frame around a pale illustration of leaves."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Low rectangular coffee table in pale oak between the chairs, simple flat top with slim legs. Holds a clear glass jug of water half-full and three empty drinking glasses clustered near it."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Tall potted monstera beside the window on the right, planted in a terracotta pot. Broad split green leaves catch the afternoon daylight from the window."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Small trailing pothos on a low wooden stool near the back-left corner, heart-shaped green leaves spilling over the edge of the stool."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Small side cabinet against the back wall between the chairs and the window, pale wood finish. On top sits a neat stack of folded white paper towels and a closed clipboard."
      }
    ]
  }
}
